   "C# sources: the MonoBehaviour/ScriptableObject/Editor role of a declared type, its engine lifecycle callbacks and coroutines, the typeof() wiring of RequireComponent/CustomEditor/CustomPropertyDrawer, the editor-authoring attributes and GetComponent/Instantiate/Resources/SceneManager reach are materialized",
